格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Finance data toolkit for DeepSeek Harness agents: number/currency formatting (incl. Chinese wan/yi units), return & CAGR math, valuation and profitability ratios, PV/FV, risk metrics, and a data-quality checklist","id":"gh:1336663504","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-plugin-finance-data","slug":"863683348/dsh-plugin-finance-data","topics":["cordis","data","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","finance","plugin","risk"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Finance data toolkit for DeepSeek Harness agents: number/currency formatting (incl. Chinese wan/yi u"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"nits), return & CAGR math, valuation and profitability ratios, PV/FV, risk metrics, and a data-quali"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"n & CAGR math, valuation and profitability ratios, PV/FV, risk metrics, and a data-quality checklist"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-plugin-finance-data"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A **finance data toolkit** for DeepSeek Harness agents: guaranteed-correct number formatting, return"},{"id":"p3s2","text":" math, ratios, time value, and risk metrics. The model explains; the plugin does the arithmetic."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Tool schemas are validated against the `@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools` value-schema DSL at plugin load (che"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"cked against dsh-tools 0.1.0-rc.6 and 0.1.1-rc.2). Earlier releases used JSON-Schema `required` at t"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"he root of `output.schema` and closed nested objects without declared properties, which made the hos"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"t abort the whole profile boot with `unsupported JSON schema: schema.required is not supported by th"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"e value schema DSL` and could reject the tool's own results. Current releases fix both; if an affect"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"ed version left your DSH unable to start, remove the plugin from the profile (or upgrade) — no data "},{"id":"p5s7","text":"on left your DSH unable to start, remove the plugin from the profile (or upgrade) — no data is lost."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Restart DSH. The `finance_data` tool is registered host-wide."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Tool"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| action | purpose |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| `format` | Number/currency/percent formatting with thousands separators and Chinese 万/亿 units |\n| "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"`return` | Simple, log, and annualized (CAGR-style) returns |\n| `ratio` | PE, PB, ROE, ROA, gross/ne"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"t margin, debt-to-equity |\n| `value` | Present value, future value, implied rate |\n| `risk` | Mean, "},{"id":"p11s4","text":"volatility, max drawdown, historical VaR(95), Sharpe from a return series |\n| `checklist` | Data-qua"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"lity checklist (source, as-of date, units, definitions) |\n| `plan` | DCA / compound-interest project"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"ion — future value schedule, inflation-adjusted real value |\n| `portfolio` | Portfolio weights, drif"},{"id":"p11s7","text":"t vs targets, and rebalance buy/sell orders |\n| `trend` | Metric time series — mean, extremes, direc"},{"id":"p11s8","text":"tion (slope), volatility |\n| `peer` | Value vs peer group — P10/P50/P90 and percentile rank |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Config"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"All optional, on the composition row's `config`:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| key | default | meaning |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| `personaSection` | `true` | register the finance prompt-guidance section |\n| `sectionOrder` | `6` "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"| prompt section order (persona is 0, ascending) |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Design"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Pure logic (`lib/finance.js`) has zero DSH/Cordis imports and is unit-tested in isolation; `lib/inde"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"x.js` is the thin Cordis plugin wiring the tool and the prompt section. No filesystem access — deter"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"ministic and side-effect free."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"MIT"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Roadmap"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"See ROADMAP.md — next five versions (v0.2.0 – v0.6.0): planning & portfolio, trends & peer compariso"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"n, cash-flow & sensitivity, bonds & FX/inflation, backtest & report export."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
